WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.240
Open a new temporary chat and upload the chapter PDF.

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:06.016
ChatGPT reads the uploaded chapter · accelerated.

00:00:06.016 --> 00:00:09.516
Write the prompt · fast typing.

00:00:09.516 --> 00:00:09.826
Send the shortcut as the second message.

00:00:09.826 --> 00:00:12.527
ChatGPT processes the prompt and builds the widget · accelerated.

00:00:12.527 --> 00:00:16.133
Inspect the generated widget before using its controls.

00:00:16.145 --> 00:00:22.035
Activate the study session with Start.

00:00:22.035 --> 00:00:26.545
Pause the session and inspect the displayed time.

00:00:26.545 --> 00:00:31.412
Use the +1 min control and inspect the displayed time.

00:00:31.412 --> 00:00:40.248
Write a training explanation at normal speed.

00:00:40.248 --> 00:00:43.800
Reveal the expected training answer.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:48.149
Mark the training recall as completed.

00:00:48.149 --> 00:00:51.437
Move to the inference activity.

00:00:51.437 --> 00:01:00.730
Explain why prompt context does not prove changed weights.

00:01:00.730 --> 00:01:06.798
Compare the answer with the expected explanation.

00:01:06.798 --> 00:01:11.161
Mark the inference activity complete.

00:01:11.161 --> 00:01:14.441
Open the context and retrieval activity.

00:01:14.441 --> 00:01:24.159
Write a retrieval explanation at normal speed.

00:01:24.159 --> 00:01:30.128
Reveal the expected retrieval explanation.

00:01:30.128 --> 00:01:36.076
Complete all three recall activities.

00:01:36.076 --> 00:01:43.869
Revisit Training with the saved written response.
